    "effect": {
      "before": "",
      "after": "<p>Power Roll + Reflex, melee or ranged. Damage by tier uses the wielded weapon's band (values shown are the Medium marksman-rifle band, sec A2). Higher against a <strong>Marked</strong> or <strong>unaware</strong> target.</p><p><strong>Tier 1:</strong> full damage plus a precision rider - +50% base (round up) OR a named condition (Bleeding/Weakened/Slowed).</p><p><strong>Hunter:</strong> your first strike against a Marked target each round gains extra reach or a damage bump.</p><p><em>Enhance - spend 1 Advantage:</em> add a surge die, or apply the Tier-1 rider one tier earlier.</p>"
